# Crumb 0: a bread crumb of golden crust (kitchen_crumb), 0.45 m long, 0.35 m wide and 0.2 m tall (60 times life size): two chunky lumps
# stuck together. Ground clutter on the worktop: no collider.
format 1

# A fifth of the vertices its size would give it: a small lump
Detail detail=0.11
    Material material=kitchen_crumb
        Union
            Translate translation=(-0.06, 0.07, 0)
                Rotate rotation=(0, 0.5, 0)
                    RoundBox size=(0.16, 0.07, 0.12) roundness=0.035
            Translate translation=(0.1, 0.1, 0.05)
                Rotate rotation=(0, 1.1, 0)
                    RoundBox size=(0.1, 0.1, 0.08) roundness=0.04
